License: MIT; see LICENSE. Submodule versions and archives are in sources.json.

Aura changes: image-pages.patch and ImageExecutableRanges.h add a disabled-by-
default option, FEX_WINDOWSIMAGEPAGES. It applies only to MgsGroundZeroes.exe,
registering the loader's committed executable image pages in the translator.
It does not modify Windows page permissions or game files. Unreadable queries
leave unknown pages excluded. Both Windows translators are rebuilt; their
exports/imports and the existing Unix bridge remain unchanged.

This is a compatibility candidate based on an observed entry execute fault.
Host tests do not establish successful Android game startup or gameplay.
